  <notes>
    Completed 2026-11-20, merged into work 04718b3224 (branch task/ebilling-132ui, tip 1e1e2db3b3). Built-in Notify step on Reject / Return; the
    banner repeat of a stranded decision carries the locked notice. Opus adversarial review: F1 banner repeat dropped the notice, F1 stale
    refusal message, F1 false over-limit on a locked subject (fixed in round 1, with K2 HTTP tag and K4 aria fixes); coordinator re-check F1
    locked repeat stuck after notice_refused (fixed in round 2). Out of scope, filed: ISS-041 #2930 (after a page reload a stranded reject or
    return cannot carry the notice, so the firm gets no email). Known limits: notes/132ui-notify-step.md. 632 package tests pass; typecheck
    clean; InvoiceReview is outside client-lint (ISS-015).
    rework: fix-round-2 task 132ui
  </notes>
</task>
